ty of the noise to residences;","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"e1579a1a-6373-5f40-8006-d3fe385e8302"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"9.45.160","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/9.45.160","content_hash":"e97dfe42207a3364a117f3e587f0fd5d2a55e3bbabd464a5f5ad943ca91c5d5e","heading":null,"ordinal":7,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.160:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.160:block:7","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/9.45.160","text":"(g) The nature and zoning of the area within which the noise emanates;","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"c2a602cb-39d5-5a9c-b20f-5c2c17194074"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"9.45.160","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/9.45.160","content_hash":"8a0502d43fcc063e7a0780c2b0d8b2a0b5230182aa6fd4773854d27af8a342ca","heading":null,"ordinal":8,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.160:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.160:block:8","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/9.45.160","text":"(h) The density of the inhabitation of the area within which the noise emanates;","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"377f919b-f913-5569-bbc0-34f5e5f6f99e"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"9.45.160","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/9.45.160","content_hash":"b2312e5d2a6a7b12e1597d82fd6f7697841e13e809bda5bb4ae9d88c0c6d4a4d","heading":null,"ordinal":9,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.160:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.160:block:9","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/9.45.160","text":"(i) The time of the day or night the noise occurs;","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"e5ae30c3-5199-5cda-a1f9-eaf1a1f90610"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"9.45.160","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/9.45.160","content_hash":"fdc114e00900877a9410d3ad40ba376a9bf5e04457cff293e4e688dc212ce49d","heading":null,"ordinal":10,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.160:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.160:block:10","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/9.45.160","text":"(j) The duration of the noise;","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"4f88a5bb-1eba-563f-8438-bdcba7bb6742"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"9.45.160","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/9.45.160","content_hash":"fd4809bb6629fe679e39eb07e6e9a2b6448460c1016cbceb27b4ecab41c0dea9","heading":null,"ordinal":11,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.160:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.160:block:11","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/9.45.160","text":"(k) Whether the noise is recurrent, intermittent or constant; and","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"53e48c2f-1ef5-58ff-9c85-b8731595c7e7"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"9.45.160","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/9.45.160","content_hash":"a8055f868944d675924e0eb39808360f13f6c68de812ab7c143a2a0304fc2308","heading":null,"ordinal":12,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.160:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.160:block:12","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/9.45.160","text":"(l) Whether the noise is produced by a commercial or noncommercial activity. (Ord. 19775 § 1, 10-23-12.)","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"4a246975